        "summary": {
          "en-US": "64-bit Android port and recreation of the classic Flappy Bird game."
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "FlappyB64bitAndroid is a source-available recreation of the original Flappy Bird game, modernized to support 64-bit Android architecture. Designed for smooth performance on newer Android devices where older 32-bit apps are no longer supported, it offers the traditional arcade gameplay without ads or bloatware.\n"
        },
