        "name": {
          "en-US": "CloudStream (Pre-release)"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Pre-release testing build for Cloudstream."
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Cloudstream Pre-release is the bleeding-edge version of Cloudstream. It includes the latest features, experimental updates, and bug fixes before they are pushed to the stable release. Suitable for testing and early adopters.\n\nKey features:\n\n- Bleeding-edge features and updates before public release\n- Early access to experimental improvements and fixes\n- Completely ad-free experience\n- No analytics, telemetry, or user tracking\n- Offline downloads for local media playback\n- Full Chromecast support\n- Integrated bookmarks, history, and episode tracking\n- Modular extension system for external providers\n- Optimized interface for both phones and Android TV"
        },
